      "content": "HIGH STREET 1. 5252                                                   (West Side)                                                   Nos 76 and 78 TL 0507 1/30              20.12.67. II                        GV 2. Formerly The Brewers Arms Inn.  Early C18.  Rainwater head dated 1719 with initials TS.  Colour washed brick, parapet screening roof.  3 storeys.  4 sash windows with glazing bars in reveals under flat arches, 2nd floor window aprons, lst floor scolloped arch on right.  2 ground floor canted bay windows. Nos 48 to 88 (even); Nos 94 to 100 (even) and Barn in garden of Nos 62 and 64 form a group. Listing NGR: TL0548207948"
    }
